# Copy to .env, fill in real values. Never commit .env.
# Baked into the APK at build time via react-native-config (Config.FOO in JS).
# Per docs/DECISIONS.md #22's two-listener design. Both listeners run on
# pwm-proxy (CT 200) as of the reverse-proxy migration (docs/DECISIONS.md)
# -- neither points at pwm-app's own IP anymore.

# Public mTLS listener (port 443, your subdomain) -- everything except
# /register, /cert/initial, /cert/initial-for-existing-user.
SERVER_URL=https://pwm.your-ddns-host.example.com

# LAN/VPN-only listener (port 8443, pwm-proxy's LAN IP) -- only reachable
# on the home LAN/VPN, only ever used for /register, /cert/initial,
# /login/params, /cert/initial-for-existing-user during first-device
# setup or device re-pairing.
BOOTSTRAP_URL=https://192.168.1.12:8443
